# The Chocolatey packages the Windows build installs (build/windows/install-tool.sh),
# each at a fixed version, and a hash of the files the package installed: the
# SHA-256 of the sorted "<sha256>  <path>" lines of every file under its
# install directory. Columns: package, version, tree hash. To move to a newer
# version, change the version and the hash together (the script prints the
# hash it computed when it differs).
